<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.570
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.050
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.050
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.410
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.920
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:00.470
I'm at the President's residence.

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:04.430
The President will soon make a statement.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:10.310
Good morning, my fellow citizens.

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:14.230
I'm afraid that I have sad news.

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:20.160
It's been several months since our world and Sonic's world became one.

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:26.750
Unfortunately, the two worlds will separate soon.

00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:57.610
Hi, Chris.

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:00.700
Hi, Sonic. Good morning.

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:02.320
How are you doing?

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:04.240
Good.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:07.040
It's a nice morning, Chris.

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:08.500
Yeah.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:20.800
The two worlds cannot co-exist in the same dimension.

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:29.560
They've shown us courage and touched our hearts. I'm proud that they're our heroes.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:33.310
Let's show them our thanks.

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:39.900
I think it would be wonderful if time freezes.

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:42.740
I can be pretty forever.

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:48.120
But I think it'll be boring to live the same day over and over.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:52.000
I'll be bored. It won't be fun.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:53.000
That's true.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.460
I have to go to school.

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:56.880
See you later.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:04:00.260
Have a good day.

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:06.600
It's no good.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:09.060
I wonder what's wrong?

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:14.770
On behalf of the people, I'd like to extend our gratitude.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:21.400
Sonic and friends, we'll never forget you.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.110
Sheesh!

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:28.530
He's not going to say anything about Sonic endangering our world?

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:34.540
Instead of beating around the bush, we should get rid of them by force!

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:36.000
What?

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:39.130
Eggman is doing something suspicious.

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:44.800
He's building a strange device. What should we do?

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:49.640
Remain on standby.

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:53.680
Keep your eye on him and contact me if there's any change.

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:54.690
Roger.

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:59.650
Like I thought, Eggman won't let this opportunity pass!

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:02.110
He's going to attack us.

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:08.200
I can't let politicians handle this anymore! I have to take over!

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:22.880
Eggman brought chaos to this world, so I'm going to crush him!

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:25.880
I'm going to miss them.

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:29.470
There's nothing we can do. They're from a different world.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:31.680
It can't be helped.

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:38.650
But I'm still going to miss them. I thought Sonic and I would be together forever.

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:46.030
I also thought Sonic and I could be together forever.

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:49.780
Tell me! I'll do anything you say!

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:50.990
Sonic!

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:55.410
Since that day, we were always together.

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:11.220
Begin the attack!

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:19.140
What's going on?

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:23.230
How did they find out that we were hiding here?

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:25.860
It must be him!

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:29.610
This is great!

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:36.250
Eggman is hiding near the Mystic Ruins. It's like you can't see the forest for the trees.

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:45.170
Who ordered the attack?

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:51.840
We've taken control of the President.

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:59.310
Who are they?

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:02.520
What's going on inside?

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:04.730
Where's the President?

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:19.080
They're beating you up, Eggman.

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:21.790
I'm outnumbered.

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:27.880
They're fools for launching an all-out attack against just one genius scientist.

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.510
Ouch!

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:34.140
Shouldn't you run away, Eggman?

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:37.560
We're losers if we run! We'll fight!

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:43.310
Here you go!

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:49.490
We really should run away, Dr. Eggman.

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:53.160
If they destroy this fortress, we're doomed.

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:56.030
We can't allow it to be destroyed.

00:07:56.780 --> 00:08:01.080
Either way, I won't be satisfied until I destroy them all!

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:04.630
Anyway, leave this to me and get out of here.

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:06.710
I don't recall asking for your help.

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:11.420
They're bullying you, Eggman.

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:15.760
We need your help! Help us!

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:17.010
OK.

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:29.190
This is the Director. Come in.

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:33.360
This is Topaz.

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:38.580
Eggman is the target of an all-out attack, but Sonic is helping him!

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:41.540
How annoying!

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:46.420
Sonic's Freedom Movement is the reason why the citizens are lazy!

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:49.750
Also destroy Sonic!

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:53.260
Eliminate him and Eggman!

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:05.810
Shovel Claw!

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:12.740
You're such a blundering echidna.

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:13.570
Bat girl!

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:16.360
This is Topaz. What's going on, Rouge?

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:20.330
This is Rouge. I ran into a hibernating echidna.

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.620
I'll make sure he sleeps in the dirt again.

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:27.420
Understood. The President is confined in his office.

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:29.540
Rescue him.

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:30.460
I know.

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:31.800
Be careful.

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:34.970
She worries too much.

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:50.310
We need to combine!

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:51.480
Yeah!

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:52.690
Push!

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:11.210
Combine!

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:12.170
Right!

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:23.220
This is the giant fortress Grand Egg Imperial!

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:27.350
All you did was combine everything we had together.

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:28.850
What a ripoff.

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:33.110
Be quiet. I won't be satisfied until I hit them back twice as hard!

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:35.110
Return fire!

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:36.570
Aye aye, sir!

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:51.500
Thanks for waiting, Mr. President.

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:54.380
Miss Rouge!

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:55.750
Mr. President!

00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:00.760
Thank you. You saved me.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:14.820
Goodbye, Sonic.

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:23.820
Oh, I almost forgot. Here you go.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:26.830
This is...

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:34.330
Mr. President, we arrested the commander in charge of the coup.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:35.670
Take him away.

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:37.710
Sonic! Eggman!

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:41.800
None of this would've happened if they never came here!

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:45.390
How annoying!

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:51.020
Mr. President, to be honest, you think Sonic is a nuisance, don't you?

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:55.270
What? It all began when Eggman caused Chaos Control!

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:59.360
None of us would be here if it wasn't for that!

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:02.280
It's not just Eggman's fault.

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:08.790
Many factors lead to a result.

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:13.710
It's never a single person's fault.

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:19.090
But no one wanted to merge the two worlds together.

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:22.380
That's the truth.

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:26.890
Everyone wants someone else to take the blame.

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:30.390
This is it!

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:33.390
With this, the device will be complete!

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:35.480
Put it in, Tails.

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:37.770
Yeah. Let's hurry, Chuck.

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:40.440
Eggman...

00:12:52.140 --> 00:12:56.020
Episode 50

00:12:52.140 --> 00:12:56.020
Morning of Farewells

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:02.510
The day is finally here.

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:11.770
The day we part.

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:28.620
The day I say goodbye to Sonic.

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:32.290
We should go too, dear.

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:37.170
You're right. Let's look after him in secret.

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:57.100
Hey, Sonic.

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:58.150
Huh?

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:02.270
Do you want to go back to your world?

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:04.280
Not really.

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:09.570
No matter where I am, I'm never going to change.

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:11.740
Sonic...

00:14:31.090 --> 00:14:32.100
Goodbye.

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:33.140
Take care.

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:35.350
I'll never forget you.

00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:43.320
It's ready to go, Tails.

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:46.110
Activate!

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:57.000
It's no good. There's not enough power.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:00.370
What should we do? We don't have enough Chaos Emeralds.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:08.220
If they can't find any Chaos Emeralds, the machine won't work.

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:11.130
That means Sonic will have to stay here!

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:13.600
I have a Chaos Emerald.

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:21.770
Hooray! It's a Chaos Emerald!

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:24.360
Okay, Tails. Put it in!

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:32.660
Activate!

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:56.010
No! I haven't properly said goodbye to everyone yet!

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:58.770
Bye bye!

00:15:58.770 --> 00:15:59.520
See ya!

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:01.350
So long!

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:08.230
No way. It disappeared.

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:12.400
We can't go home?

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:21.710
Since the gate has disappeared, there's no guarantee that those remaining can go home.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:23.670
What's going on?

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:34.340
I'm not giving up.

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:38.560
Tails.

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:43.390
Chuck, you're the one who taught me never to give up.

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:45.560
That's right.

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:52.940
Sam.

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:58.280
What was that?

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:05.420
I say hello quickly, but I also say goodbye quickly.

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:09.590
Sonic, it feels like our race took place just yesterday.

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:17.590
Damn! You're just going to beat me and leave?

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:21.390
He's gone in a flash.

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:23.980
He's shy.

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:32.610
How's this?

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:34.570
Let's activate it.

00:18:08.140 --> 00:18:09.400
What's this?

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:12.270
It's from the ARK!

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:16.070
The power is incredible! This will work!

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:18.110
Well done, Tails!

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:27.660
Chuck?

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:30.630
Take care, Tails.

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:33.800
You too, Chuck.

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:39.010
I'll never forget what you taught me.

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:51.020
This is a symbol of our friendship.

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:53.020
We all made it together.

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:54.650
Goodbye.

00:18:55.190 --> 00:19:02.530
Thank you. I'm so happy. We're friends forever!

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:15.380
Don't cry, Ella. You're making me want to cry.

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:20.550
I'll pretend that this cactus is you and take care of it forever.

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:23.930
Take care, Amy.

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:28.930
You too, Ella. Thank you for everything.

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:31.140
Thank you too, Tanaka.

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:37.400
I also had a fun time. Amy, please take care.

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:40.320
Amy, take this.

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:47.700
Ella's special Amy Rose-style apple pie... Ella!

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:52.420
Thank you! I love you, Ella!

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:53.830
Amy!

00:19:56.000 --> 00:20:03.890
Can I really say "Thank you" and "Goodbye" to Sonic like everyone else?

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:09.180
And they all live happily ever after.

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:12.770
By the way, who are you?

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:15.110
It's a secret.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:21.440
Everyone, hurry! This gate may not last long either, so you have to go before it vanishes!

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:23.070
Thank you for your hospitality.

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:26.070
Goodbye, everyone. Take care!

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:33.670
Goodbye.

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:40.460
Goodbye!

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:48.970
Goodbye, Cream.

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:50.640
Goodbye, Amy.

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:52.640
Goodbye, Tails.

00:20:54.890 --> 00:21:00.690
It's very rare that I give someone a gift. You should be grateful.

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:07.990
See you.

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:26.130
We're the only ones left, Sonic.

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:29.720
Let's go.

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:33.220
Okay.

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:35.100
Sonic!

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:46.150
Be strong, Chris. Make sure you say goodbye.

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:48.490
Be strong, Chris.

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:51.740
Sonic.

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:54.370
Chris.

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:56.330
Take care.

00:21:58.120 --> 00:21:59.580
No...

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:02.920
It's been fun.

00:22:06.130 --> 00:22:07.590
No...

00:22:07.880 --> 00:22:11.550
Thank you. Goodbye.

00:22:12.890 --> 00:22:14.970
No!

00:22:18.520 --> 00:22:20.480
No!

00:22:24.900 --> 00:22:28.070
No!

00:22:36.660 --> 00:22:38.370
Chris?

00:22:56.850 --> 00:23:00.650
<b>Ikuse! Ikina furumaide nomiso <i>engine</i>  furukaiten</b>

00:22:56.850 --> 00:23:00.650
<i>Let's go with a positive attitude. Brain engine full rotation</i>

00:23:00.650 --> 00:23:02.520
<b>Shiteyattemiyoze eronnakoto</b>

00:23:00.650 --> 00:23:02.520
<i>Let's try various things</i>

00:23:02.520 --> 00:23:04.860
<b>ni zen nokakete i donnakoto</b>

00:23:02.520 --> 00:23:04.860
<i>Tackle them with everything we got</i>

00:23:04.860 --> 00:23:06.610
<b>Chance baitori <i>Jump like Sonic</i></b>

00:23:04.860 --> 00:23:06.610
<i>Double the chance. Jump like Sonic!</i>

