<b>Shogaiwa hitotsuno janrunai <i>topic</i></b>

00:23:06.610 --> 00:23:08.780
<i>Life is a topic with more than one genre</i>

00:23:08.780 --> 00:23:10.240
<b>Bikkutoshine de <i>big dream</i></b>

00:23:08.780 --> 00:23:10.240
<i>Don't be scared  Big dream</i>

